"P4143401968" "They're a menace not only to The Hollows, but all of Paragon City.  Anywhere you find them is okay by me.  This isn't a PPD mandated activity report."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3638660310" "Defeat Circle of Thorns"
// YoureStillBusyString :
